       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "30509349"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Was originally proposed to be a calcium channel facilitator (By similarity). However, a more recent study shows that this protein regulates membrane phospholipid homeostasis (PubMed:30509349). Therefore, any effects on calcium flux are most likely a secondary consequence of defects in membrane composition or fluidity (PubMed:30509349)"
    }
